:: Temple Confess Tutorial
<<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to "temple">><<temple_effects>><<effects>>
<<npc Jordan>><<person1>>
본당 벽 쪽에 외따로 떨어져 있는 고해소로 다가간다. 화려한 상징 문양들이 중앙 장식을 따라 춤추듯 새겨져 있고, 양옆의 육중한 나무문까지 이어져 있다.
오른쪽은 죄인들이 고해하는 곳이고, 왼쪽은 고해 사제를 위한 자리다. 가운데에는 작은 놋쇠 종이 매달려 있다.
<br><br>

고해소 주변의 바닥 돌에는 커다란 반원 모양의 흠집이 나 있다.
<br><br>

"자신이 없는 모양이구나, 아이여." 누군가 당신의 어깨에 손을 얹는다. 조던이다. "고해 사제 역할을 해보고 싶은 게지? 내가 어떻게 하는지 가르쳐 주마."
<br><br>

<<templeicon "confession">><<link [[승낙한다 (0:30)|Temple Confess Tutorial 2]]>><<pass 30>><<npcincr "Jordan" love 1>><</link>><<glove>>
<br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[거절한다|Temple]]>><<endevent>><</link>>
<br>

:: Temple Confess Tutorial 2
<<temple_effects>><<effects>>
당신은 고개를 끄덕이고 조던과 함께 고해소 안으로 들어간다.
<br><br>

내부는 밖에서 보는 것보다 넓어 두 사람이 들어가기에 충분하다. 앞에는 푹신한 쿠션이 깔린 벤치가 놓여 있다.
조던은 양쪽을 나누는 나무 살창을 가리켰다. "이것이 바로 고해의 인장이란다. 고해자의 죄가 철저히 비밀에 부쳐짐을 뜻하는 상징이지. 그들의 죄는 오직 너를 통해서만 주님께 닿는단다."
<br><br>

당신은 인장 아래에 있는 작은 금속 셔터와, 그 밑 벽에 붙어 있는 은색 그릇에 눈길을 준다. 조던이 당신의 시선을 알아챈다. "저건 순결의 상징이야. 저 은 그릇은 고해자의 죄를 거두어들이고, 그곳에서 죄는 씻은 듯이 용서받지."
<br><br>

<<He>>【은는】 벤치 옆에 늘어진 밧줄을 가리킨다. "이걸 당기면 밖의 종이 울리게 되어 있어. 서약을 어겼다고 고해하는 신전 식구들을 마주했을 때만 이 종을 울려야 한다. 그러면 정화를 담당할 전문가들을 부르게 될 게야."
<br><br>

<<link [[다음|Temple Confess Tutorial 3]]>><</link>>
<br>

:: Temple Confess Tutorial 3
<<temple_effects>><<effects>>
조던은 작은 향 조각들이 가득 담긴 상자로 시선을 옮겼다.
<br><br>

"고해자가 들어올 때마다 향을 피우고, '환영합니다. 죄를 남김없이 고백하여 용서받으십시오'라고 말하렴. 웬만하면 고해자를 용서하고 올바른 길로 이끌어야 할 거다. 용서를 전할 땐, '말로써 당신의 죄를 사하노니, 이제 행동으로 스스로를 용서해야 할 것입니다'라고 말하면 돼. 만일 너무나 무거운 죄를 짓거나 불법적인 일을 고백한다면, 그때는 단호히 회개를 명해야 한단다."
<br><br>

<<He>>【은는】 말을 이어갔다. "만약 고해자가 도저히 감당할 수 없을 만큼 깊은 죄악과 타락에 물들었다고 여겨지거든, 이 종이 중 하나에 그들의 이름과 주소를 적어내라고 명하렴." <<He>>【은는】 고해의 인장 반대편 선반에 쌓인 종이 더미를 가리킨다.
"우린 이걸 통회의 증표라고 부른단다. 자신의 성스러운 이름을 내어놓고, 온 세상에 그 죄를 밝힘으로써 비로소 용서받는 길이지. 전문가들이 후일 그들을 찾아가 정화를 도울 거란다."
<br><br>

조던은 당신의 머리에 다정히 손을 얹는다. "늘 가장 지혜로운 판단으로 네 고해자들을 마주하거라. 난 네가 훌륭히 해낼 거라 믿어. 신의 가호가 함께하길."
<br><br>

<<He>>【은는】 고해소에 당신만 남겨두고 떠났다.
<<endevent>>
<br><br>

<<link [[고해자를 기다린다|Temple Confess]]>><</link>>
<br>

:: Temple Confess Start
<<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to "temple">><<temple_effects>><<effects>>
<<if $phase is 1>>
	<<set $phase to 0>>
	당신은 고해소의 왼쪽 방으로 들어간다. 푹신한 쿠션이 깔린 벤치가 놓여 있고, 당신은 그곳에 자리를 잡는다.
	<br><br>

	당신의 왼쪽에는 밖의 종과 연결된 밧줄, 그리고 고해소 반대편을 차단하는 나무 살창들이 자리 잡고 있다.
	나무 살창에는 온갖 상징 문양들이 빼곡히 새겨져 있다. 그 바로 밑에는 작은 금속 셔터가 달려 있고, 그 셔터 아래 벽에는 은색 그릇이 붙어 있다.
	오른쪽에는 종이 더미가 정갈하게 쌓여 있다.
	<br><br>

	벤치 위쪽 선반에는 여분의 수건이 가지런히 놓여 있다.
<<else>>
	당신은 고해소 안에서 고해 사제 역할을 맡고 있다.
<</if>>
<br><br>

<<if Time.weekDay is 1 and Time.hour gte 11 and Time.hour lte 12>>
	<<set _closeReason to "mass">>
<<elseif Time.hour lt 6 or Time.hour gte 22>>
	<<set _closeReason to "the night">>
<</if>>

<<if _closeReason>>
	문을 두드리는 소리가 들린다. "<<if _closeReason is "mass">>미사가 시작되어<<else>>밤이 늦어<</if>> 고해소가 문을 닫습니다, <<sister>>님. 오늘 수고 많으셨습니다."
	<br><br>

	당신이 밖으로 나오자, 짙은 사제복을 입은 <<generateConfessor 1>><<person1>><<monk>> 한 명이 미소 짓고 있다. <<He>>【은는】 당신이 나오자 문을 굳게 걸어 잠근다.
	<br><br>

	<<link [[다음|Temple]]>><<endconfession>><</link>>
	<br>
<<else>>
	<<if $exposed gte 1>>
		당신은 머리 위의 선반에서 수건 몇 장을 꺼내 든다.
		<<dry_full>>
		<<silently>><<exposure>><</silently>>
		<<if $exposed gte 1>>
			<<towelup>>
		<</if>>
		<br><br>
	<</if>>

	<<link [[고해자를 기다린다 (0:30)|Temple Confess]]>><<pass 30>><</link>>
	<br>
	<<link [[떠난다|Temple]]>><<endconfession>><</link>>
	<br>
<</if>>

:: Temple Confess
<<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to "temple">><<sydneySchedule>><<temple_effects>><<effects>><<rngWraith>>
<<set $confessionsTaken = ($confessionsTaken || 0) + 1>>
<<if _wraithEvent and $wraithIntro and !$weekly.wraithConfess>>
	<<set _wraithConfess to true>><<set $weekly.wraithConfess to true>><<set $attendant to "wraith">><<set _noOptions to true>>
	You hear the other door open. Before you can greet your penitent, you feel a cold wind blow. It steals your breath.

	<<if $demon gte 6 and $wraith.state isnot "haunt">>
		You can almost feel what is on the other side of the booth. All that separates you are misunderstandings.
	<</if>>
	<br><br>

	"Welcome. Lay your sins bare, so they may be forgiven," you say. You do your best to keep your voice even. When you go to light the incense, the flame flickers out no matter how many times you try.
<<else>>
	You hear the other door open and greet your attendant.
	"Welcome. Lay your sins bare, so they may be forgiven." You light the incense and do your best to speak outside your usual tone.
<</if>>
<br><br>

<<cleareventpool>>

<!-- Corrupted penitents (contrition or purge) -->
<<if $confessionsTaken gte 5>>
	<<addinlineevent "confession_corrupt_1" 0.7>>
		<<generate1>><<person1>><<set $attendant to "corrupt_1">>
		They sit down, panting and out of breath. A <<personssimple>> voice greets you. "Holes. So many holes. In the world. In others. In me. No one else sees them. But you do, don't you? That's your job, isn't it?"
	<</addinlineevent>>
	<<addinlineevent "confession_corrupt_2" 0.7>>
		<<generate1>><<person1>><<set $attendant to "corrupt_2">>
		They sit down. A <<personssimple>> voice greets you. "Hello, dear <<sister>>. I fear I've done some rather dreadful things. For the past month or so, I've been seeing a prostitute every day.
		Each time we meet, our acts become more and more depraved, and now, I find myself thinking about nothing but these carnal deeds. Today I even caught myself thinking about stealing this sex worker away to be locked away in my basement. Thus, I decided to come here."
	<</addinlineevent>>
	<<addinlineevent "confession_corrupt_3" 0.7>>
		<<generate1>><<person1>><<set $attendant to "corrupt_3">>
		They sit down. A <<personssimple>> anxious voice greets you. "I fear I've angered God," <<he>> says.
		<br><br>

		After a moment of silence, you encourage <<him>> to elaborate.
		<br><br>

		"I've started seeing... visions. Hearing voices. They tell me to do terrible things until I am a terrible thing myself. I know they aren't real, no matter how real they feel. I... I don't know what I've done wrong or what I should do to make it stop."
	<</addinlineevent>>
	<<addinlineevent "confession_corrupt_4" 0.7>>
		<<generatey1>><<person1>><<set $attendant to "corrupt_4">>
		They sit. A <<personssimple>> voice greets you. "Hello, <<sister>>. I've been having some... horrible thoughts lately. Things I would never think of on purpose. I... can I share? Some of them are really bad."
		<br><br>

		You give <<him>> permission to continue.
		<br><br>

		"I've had thoughts about other initiates. Thoughts about making them break their vows just to see them get punished. Thoughts about other members of our order and how I'd like them to... defile... me. Thoughts about <<nnpc_brother "Jordan">> Jordan... I even had my <<if $pronoun is "m">>cage<<else>>belt<</if>> removed just to have <<nnpc_him "Jordan">> close to me."
		<br><br>

		<<He>> begins to sob. "And... and I'm starting to like these thoughts! I hate that I like them! They aren't mine! This isn't who I am!"
	<</addinlineevent>>
	<<addinlineevent "confession_corrupt_5" 0.7>>
		<<generate1>><<person1>><<set $attendant to "corrupt_5">>
		They sit. A <<personssimple>> voice greets you. "I will waste no time, <<sister>>. The taint has taken me. Please, purge it from my being."
	<</addinlineevent>>
	<<addinlineevent "confession_corrupt_fake" 0.7>>
		<<generate1>><<person1>><<set $attendant to "corrupt_5_fake">>
		They sit. A <<personssimple>> voice greets you. "I will waste no time, <<sister>>. The taint has taken me. Please, purge it from my being."
	<</addinlineevent>>
	<<addinlineevent "confession_corrupt_6" 0.7>>
		<<generatey1>><<person1>><<set $attendant to "corrupt_6">>
		They sit. A <<personssimple>> exasperated voice greets you. "S-someone did something to me, <<sister>>. I can't... it feels like I can't breathe without taking in every sin committed in this town. But, it feels like it's somehow my fault."
	<</addinlineevent>>
	<<addinlineevent "confession_corrupt_7" 0.7>>
		<<generate1>><<person1>><<set $attendant to "corrupt_7">>
		They sit. A <<personssimple>> voice greets you. "Forgive me, <<sister>>, for I have... oh, what haven't I done? It feels as though my body has died, and the only way I can live again is through horrible acts of sin. It's all I can do."
	<</addinlineevent>>
	<<addinlineevent "confession_corrupt_8" 0.7>>
		<<generatey1>><<person1>><<set $attendant to "corrupt_8">>
		They sit. A <<personssimple>> monotone voice greets you. "Forgive me. Please forgive me. Please forgive me. Please forgive me. Please forgive me."
		<br><br>

		You attempt to question <<him>> on what <<he>> needs to be forgiven for. <<He>> simply continues to repeat <<himself>>.
	<</addinlineevent>>
	<<addinlineevent "confession_corrupt_9" 1>>
		<<generate1>><<person1>><<set $attendant to "corrupt_9">>
		They sit. A <<personssimple>> voice greets you as <<he>> presses <<his>> hand against the seal.
		<<if $angel gte 6>>
			"Oh my, I'm blessed indeed. You're angelic. I can feel your radiance through the seal. May this poor wretch humbly request you purge me of my sins?"
		<<elseif $fallenangel gte 2>>
			"Oh my, it seems I'm not the only one in need of forgiveness. Your bitterness and loss... I can smell it. Why don't we purge each others' sins, <<sister>>?"
		<<elseif $demon gte 6>>
			"Ahh, a corrupt vessel. Fascinating that you've started to climb the ranks. You're in good company, <<sister>>. My bowl is full, and I must purge it."
		<<elseif $wolfgirl gte 6>>
			"What an odd presence. Wouldn't you be more at home in the forest with your kin, <<sister>>? No matter. I am here to purge."
		<<elseif $cat gte 6>>
			"Ahh, I hope your tongue isn't too rough, <<sister>>. I'm afraid the only milk I have to offer is that of flesh and sin."
		<<elseif $cow gte 6>>
			"This one is a bastion of vital force. How curious, I didn't expect that glorified farmhand to let any of you escape. Oh well, I'll keep your secret so long as you purge me of my sins."
		<<elseif $harpy gte 6>>
			"Unbefitting of one with such beautiful wings to confine themselves to this stuffy box of sins. Help me sing, <<sister>>. Sing for salvation."
		<<elseif $fox gte 6>>
			"You're a tricky one. I almost didn't feel you here. No matter. You likely already know why I'm here, <<sister>>. To purge."
		<<else>>
			"I suppose you'll have to do. Please help me purge my sins, <<sister>>."
		<</if>>
	<</addinlineevent>>
<</if>>

<!-- Sinful penitents (forgive, repent, or either) -->
<<addinlineevent "confession_sinner_1" 1>>
	<<generate1>><<person1>><<set $attendant to "sinner_1">>
	They sit down with a sigh. A <<personssimple>> voice greets you. "Forgive me, <<sister>>, for I have..." <<He>> pauses.
	"I did something horrible. I... There was this
	<<if maleChance($pronoun) gte random(1, 100)>>
		boy. He needed money really bad, to pay someone off, I think. I... I made him do things.
		<<if random(1,100) lte $settings.npcVirginChanceStudent>>
			I ended up taking his virginity.
		<</if>>
		He didn't seem to mind,
	<<else>>
		girl. She needed money really bad, to pay someone off, I think. I... I made her do things.
		<<if $NPCList[0].penis is 0>>
			<<if random(1,100) lte $settings.npcVirginChanceStudent>>
				I ended up taking her virginity.
			<</if>>
			She didn't seem to mind,
		<<else>>
			<<if random(1,100) lte $settings.npcVirginChanceStudent>>
				I think I was her first.
			<</if>>
			She didn't seem to mind,
		<</if>>
	<</if>>
	but I still feel so rotten."
<</addinlineevent>>
<<addinlineevent "confession_sinner_2" 1>>
	<<generate1>><<person1>><<set $attendant to "sinner_2">>
	They sit down. A <<personssimple>> voice greets you. "Hey, I heard if I confess something bad enough, you guys will literally suck the sin out of me. That true? In that case, I'm full of sin! I... thought about masturbating today! Yeah!"
<</addinlineevent>>
<<addinlineevent "confession_sinner_3" 1>>
	<<generatey1>><<person1>><<set $attendant to "sinner_3">>
	They sit down. A <<personssimple>> voice greets you. "F-forgive me, <<sister>>, for I have sinned. I... I masturbated in class." A pause. "...and in the library. And during detention. And during the last exam."
<</addinlineevent>>
<<addinlineevent "confession_sinner_4" 1>>
	<<generatey1>><<person1>><<set $attendant to "sinner_4">>
	They sit down. A <<personssimple>> voice greets you. "Forgive me, <<sister>>, for I have sinned. I skipped school."
<</addinlineevent>>
<<addinlineevent "confession_sinner_5" 1>>
